#### [P2-2] Add PAUSE Uncertainty Thresholds

**Status**: Not Started
**Effort**: Medium (3-5 days)
**Dependencies**: P0-2 (Confidence Levels)
**Spec Reference**: CLAUDE.md lines 193-215 (Pausing for Clarification) • **Status Reference**: STATUS-2025-12-09-043855.md section 3 (Confidence Calibration, lines 318-350)

##### Description

Evaluators have guidance on WHAT to output when pausing (lines 193-215 in project-evaluator) but unclear WHEN to pause. work-evaluator recommends PAUSE reactively (after bugs found) not proactively (before wasting time). Add automatic PAUSE triggers based on uncertainty thresholds.

##### Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] Both evaluators include "When to PAUSE (Stop Workflow)" section
- [ ] Four automatic PAUSE triggers defined:
  - [ ] Ambiguity with no clear resolution: 3+ magic numbers/assumptions and unclear which are correct
  - [ ] Runtime broken with unclear fix: Failure root cause ambiguous (config vs bug vs spec)
  - [ ] Multiple valid paths: 2+ implementation approaches equally reasonable, need user choice
  - [ ] Validation confidence <50%: Majority of features UNCERTAIN or UNKNOWN
- [ ] PAUSE output requirements: Specific questions, Why continuing wastes time (what needs rebuilding), Options with tradeoffs
- [ ] Philosophy documented: "PAUSE is not failure. It's preventing waste."
- [ ] Workflow integration: If evaluator outputs PAUSE recommendation, implementers must not proceed until user resolves (integrates with P1-1 Gate 4)
- [ ] Tested with scenario triggering each PAUSE condition
- [ ] Tested that PAUSE output includes required elements (questions, waste explanation, options)

##### Technical Notes

**Files to modify**:
- `/Users/bmf/icode/loom99-claude-marketplace/plugins/do-more-now/agents/project-evaluator.md` (expand lines 193-215 with WHEN triggers)
- `/Users/bmf/icode/loom99-claude-marketplace/plugins/do-more-now/agents/work-evaluator.md` (add WHEN triggers to PAUSE guidance)

**Integration with confidence levels**: "Validation confidence <50%" trigger uses confidence distribution from P0-2. If VERIFIED + LIKELY < 50%, automatic PAUSE recommended.

**Integration with workflow gates**: Gate 4 (No Active PAUSE) from P1-1 checks whether latest STATUS includes PAUSE recommendation. If yes, implementers cannot proceed until user addresses questions.

