  ↓
P2-2 (PAUSE Thresholds) - Uses confidence levels for <50% trigger

P0-4 (Deterministic Validation)
  ↓
P1-2 (VALIDATION_DEBT.md) - Tracks USER_VALIDATES items from feasibility assessment

P2-1 (Consolidate Duplicates) - Independent
P2-3 (Terse Examples) - Independent
```

**Critical path**: P0-4 → P1-2 → P1-1 (longest dependency chain)

**Parallel work opportunities**:
- P0-1, P0-2, P0-3 can be done in parallel (no dependencies)
- P2-1 and P2-3 can be done anytime (no dependencies)
- After P0-2 completes, P1-1 and P2-2 can run in parallel

